    "long_instructions": "# Making Sense of Data: Three Reads Strategy\r\n\r\n#### After learning the basics of a spreadsheet, students will use the **Three Reads** strategy to examine the pizza party data in <a href='https://studio.code.org/courses/artificial-intelligence-foundations-v2-2025/units/6/lessons/3' target='_blank' rel='noopener noreferrer' style='text-decoration: none; font-weight: bold;'>Lesson 3</a>.  \r\n\r\n#### This strategy encourages students to look deeply at data like a data scientist by making sense of the data they are working with and is one of the featured strategies in the <a href=\"https://docs.google.com/document/d/1Oqj_REx445lkjKOOW1xAKcJDv-6_nLD0kGUrR5iXTaE/edit?usp=sharing\" target=\"blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Guide to Language Routines</a>.\r\n\r\n<div style=\"background-color: #F5F7F8; color: #000000; padding: 15px; border-radius: 10px; width: 90%; margin: 20px auto;\">\r\n<p style = \"font-size:14pt;\"><strong>The Three Reads:</strong></p>\r\n  <ul style = \"font-size:14pt;\">\r\n    <li><strong>Read 1: Context</strong> – What is this data about?</li><br>\r\n    <li><strong>Read 2: Quantities</strong> – What quantities do you notice? </li><br>\r\n    <li><strong>Read 3: Questions</strong> – What questions can I answer using this data?</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</div>\r\n\r\n\r\n## 📝 To Do\r\n\r\n#### Let's try the first read!\r\n\r\n#### Take a look at the data below. Use the sentence starters to help you answer the question: **What is this data about?**\r\n- #### This data is from...\r\n- #### I know that...\r\n- #### A pattern I see is...\r\n- #### The data is organized...\r\n\r\n##### *The sentence starters are here to help you think about your answer. You do not have to answer all of them.*\r\n\r\n<img src=\"https://images.code.org/ec50df7f593a0b42a051016e9c923b50-image-1721233031201.16.52 PM.png\" alt=\"spreadsheet of dataset with pizza preferences\" alt=\"diagram of software: system software, application software, and utlity software with examples of icons of each\" alt=\"chatbot lab level\" width=\"30%\" style=\"border: 2px solid black; border-radius: 8px; display: block; margin: auto; width: 40%;\">\r\n<br>\r\n\r\n",
